**House Thawnkoop** (/'*θɔːnkoːp*/, *[[arethian|Arethian]]*: Θωνκοπ) are one of the four [[enkoan-trading-houses|Enkoan Trading Houses]]. They are head of the Seawright Trading Company and are known for their large fleet and thus capacity.

## Etymology
A amalgamation of *Thawnersong*, meaning ocean, and *Koopaa*, meaning wind.

## History
The House is said to be founded by Aric Thawnkoop, one of the sons of Wylan Seagrin. He inherited his fathers masterful shipbuilding prowess. As such, when he founded Seawright Trading Company they built a large fleet. This fleet now sails across all the oceans.
